  "contentHtml": "<div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"bb8eu-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"bb8eu-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"bb8eu-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">학교에 담임 선생님과 부장선생님들께 인원점검명렬표2017 앱을 설치해 드렸더니 처음에는 뭔지 의아해 하시더니, 사용법을 알려 드렸더니&nbsp; 너무 좋아하시네요.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"42q60-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"42q60-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"42q60-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">어떻게 사용하는지 모르시는 분이 많으셔서 사용법을 동영상으로 따로 만들었습니다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"5u5k7-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"5u5k7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"5u5k7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">동영상을 한번 보시면 선생님들이 왜 좋아하시는지 알 수 있습니다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"an4p7-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"an4p7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"an4p7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">학기초에 한번만 작업해 놓으면 1년동안 편하게 사용할 수 있고, 원하는 학생에게도 바로 전화할 수 있습니다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"3lbek-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"3lbek-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"3lbek-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/nLdH58p96HY\">https://youtu.be/nLdH58p96HY</a></span></span></div><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"3lbek-0-0\"><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nLdH58p96HY\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"q8e7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"q8e7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">우리학교는 구글설문지로 학생들 이름과 연락처를 받아서, 변환시켜서 인원점검명렬표2017 앱에 카톡을 이용해서 입력하고 있습니다.</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"53d43-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"53d43-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"53d43-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"dqvmm-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"dqvmm-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"dqvmm-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">담임선생님들이 만든 명단을 카톡으로 보내주면 교과선생님이나 부장선생님들도 바로 입력해서 사용가능합니다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"3ed3q-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"3ed3q-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"3ed3q-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"duo1n-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"duo1n-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"duo1n-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">입력하는 방법과 사용방법은 아래 링크 참고하세요</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"ju82-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"ju82-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"ju82-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" data-offset-key=\"asl02-0-0\" data-editor=\"v3t9\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"asl02-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"asl02-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\"><a href=\"http://sciencelove.com/2155\">http://sciencelove.com/2155</a></span></span></div><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"asl02-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"asl02-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\"></span></span></div></div><div style=\"